  "Passive optical and infrared telescope. Spots sunlit rocks and stations far off, warm hulls close by, a firing ship's engine plume far off, and any radar that transmits. Silent: it gives nothing away.": "Passive optical and infrared telescope. Spots sunlit rocks and stations far off, warm hulls close by, a firing ship's engine plume far off, and any radar that transmits. Silent: it gives nothing away.",
